{"id":"b029734fc0b3cad0","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-lowforcomputable-char.md","title":"可计算随机低性恰为可计算性","display":"thm-lowforcomputable-char — 可计算随机低性恰为可计算性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-lowforcomputable-char","aliases":["43-thm-lowforcomputable-char"],"display":"thm-lowforcomputable-char — 可计算随机低性恰为可计算性","depends_on":["[[43-df-lowforcomputable]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Thms.16.5.1–16.5.2, printed p.506 / PDF p.526; proof printed pp.507–511 / PDF pp.527–531","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-lowforcomputable-char"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-lowforcomputable-char</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lowforcomputable-char — 可计算随机低性恰为可计算性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ebdea3e9c19b1bf\" href=\"?note=8ebdea3e9c19b1bf\" title=\"43-df-lowforcomputable\">43-df-lowforcomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thms.16.5.1–16.5.2, printed p.506 / PDF p.526; proof printed pp.507–511 / PDF pp.527–531"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是其特征函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowForComputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ebdea3e9c19b1bf\" href=\"?note=8ebdea3e9c19b1bf\" title=\"43-df-lowforcomputable\">43-df-lowforcomputable</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForComputable}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{Computable}(\\chi_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForComputable}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{Computable}(\\chi_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>困难方向是Nies定理；本次核对书内陈述及其非上升路径、薄树证明的组织，未逐行重验全部构造。反向由可计算集合的预言机查询可被普通程序模拟得到。不要将此性质与非平凡的Schnorr随机低性混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-lowforcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"8ebdea3e9c19b1bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lowforcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"8ebdea3e9c19b1bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是其特征函数。$\\mathrm{LowForComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforcomputable]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是其特征函数。$\\mathrm{LowForComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforcomputable]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowForComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowForComputable}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{Computable}(\\chi_A).","display":true}],"bytes":1303,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-394","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-lowforcomputable-char]] — 可计算随机低性恰为可计算性"}],"outgoing":["8ebdea3e9c19b1bf","f357216a7edb035a"]}